  {"id":"fivePillars.sawm.summary","source":"components/learning/FivePillarsVisual.tsx","english":"Abstaining from food, drink, and marital relations from dawn until sunset throughout the month of Ramadan.","arabic_source":"الإمساك عن المفطرات من طلوع الفجر إلى غروب الشمس بنية العبادة.","french":"S’abstenir de manger, de boire et d’avoir des relations conjugales, de l’aube au coucher du soleil, pendant tout le mois de Ramadan.","source_refs":["Bukhari 8","Quran 2:183"]},
